<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Potash Corp started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Potash Corp started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said Thursday it started coverage of Potash Corp of Saskatchewan Inc with a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- NYSE-listed shares rose 9/16 to 80-7/16.</p>
